    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our action-packed cartoon-themed world, you'll battle waves of normal enemies every 9 rounds, while thrilling boss fights await you in the 10th! Embark on exciting adventures, upgrade your skills, and take your gameplay to the next level. Use the points you collect to unlock cards that allow you to customize and strengthen your character as you like. Plan your strategy, overcome waves of enemies, and defeat the bosses to pave your way to victory! Be ready for surprises at every turn in this adrenaline-fueled adventure!</p>",
